  -> one class for the odd squares exactly when the word of 1 drops within 3 letters: 3x+1 (10) and 7x+1 (100).
     For 3x-1 the integer 1 is a fixed point with the expanding word 111..., so odd squares (2-adically within
     1/8 of 1) start with at least 3 odd steps and then spread over every later class.

